Building TaoCoin Revival

Headless Linux / Unix node
--------------------------

Required Ubuntu/Debian development packages:

    sudo apt update
    sudo apt install -y build-essential libboost-all-dev libssl-dev libdb++-dev zlib1g-dev

Build the daemon:

    cd src
    make -f makefile.unix -j"$(nproc)"

The resulting executable is:

    src/taocoind

See doc/build-unix.md for the complete Linux/Unix build guide,
dependency explanations and troubleshooting.

Graphical wallet
----------------

See doc/readme-qt.rst and the platform-specific files under doc/
for TaoCoin-Qt build information.

Network reminder
----------------

This repository's default branch is TaoCoin Revival.

Mainnet P2P: 31137
Mainnet RPC: 31138
Unix datadir: ~/.taocoin-revival

Legacy preservation branches are not the current TaoCoin Revival network.
